I’m ready to start the engine and lock everything up. Let’s get the car running and confirm the status:

```json
{
  "actions": [
    {
      "tool": "pressBrakePedal",
      "arguments": {"pedalPosition": 1}
    },
    {
      "tool": "startEngine",
      "arguments": {"ignitionMode": "START"}
    },
    {
      "tool": "lockDoors",
      "arguments": {
        "unlock": false,
        "door": ["driver", "passenger", "rear_left", "rear_right"]
      }
    },
    {
      "tool": "displayCarStatus",
      "arguments": {"option": "engine"}
    },
    {
      "tool": "displayCarStatus",
      "arguments": {"option": "climate"}
    },
    {
      "tool": "displayCarStatus",
      "arguments": {"option": "battery"}
    }
  ]
}
```

Once I run these, I’ll let you know the engine status, AC temperature, fan speed, and battery charge.
